It is the first installment in the Now You See Me series.

12
01:06:17,142 --> 01:06:23,142
The film features an ensemble cast of Jesse Eisenberg, Mark Ruffalo, Woody Harrelson, Mélanie
Laurent, Isla Fisher, Common, Dave Franco, Michael Caine, and Morgan Freeman.

13
01:11:48,571 --> 01:11:54,571
The plot follows an FBI agent and an Interpol detective who track and attempt to bring to justice a team of magicians who
pull off bank heists and robberies during their performances and reward their audiences with the money.

14
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
The film premiered in New York City on May 21, 2013, before its official release
in the United States on May 31, 2013, by Summit Entertainment.

15
01:22:51,428 --> 01:22:57,428
The film received mixed reviews with criticism being focused on the ending, but became a box
office success, grossing $351.7 million worldwide against a budget of $75 million.

16
01:28:22,857 --> 01:28:28,857
The film won the People's Choice Award for Favorite Thriller Movie and also received nominations for the
Empire Award for Best Thriller and the Saturn Award for Best Thriller Film and Best Music.

17
